# CLI / CI automation

- Mount `/api/cicd/*` with `authOrCliToken` (JWT or CLI token); do not leave CICD controller unrouted.
- CLI entry: `tools/apiadmin-cli.mjs` + root `package.json` `bin.apiadmin` / `npm run cli`.
- Prefer JUnit (and existing report formatters) for CI consumers; support `iteration_data` on run endpoints.
- Never log raw CLI/JWT secrets; hash tokens at rest like project tokens.
